 "about": "Number Quest placement: templates the Sorting Game no longer serves. These 63 sat at rungs 6.0-8.0 until the Pro lock of 2026-11-14. They were sound items but not grade 6-8 content (fraction addition with like denominators, rectangle area and perimeter, symmetry, reading a bar chart: earlier grades' work with bigger numbers), a few used a hyphen for a minus sign, and one priced a notebook; 15 were filed under grade and domain pairs that do not exist in CCSS-M (6.NF, 7.NF, 8.NF, 6.MD, 7.MD, 8.MD, 8.RP), so the wrong labels are not kept here. The game never deals them (generator.js TEMPLATES is templates.json alone). They stay findable by id (generator.js BY_ID) for one reason: an item that was already on a learner's screen, or stored on a run in progress, when the bank changed is still graded and read aloud from the template it was dealt from. Their archetypes in generator.js are untouched. This file can be deleted once no run from before 2026-11-14 is still active.",
